---
import { v9Href } from '~/data/v9/routes';
---

<section class="g-white" id="more">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-v9-reveal><span class="tick">\</span> 03 · Eight more</div>
    <h2 data-v9-reveal style="--d:60ms">For when the problem is bigger than a role.</h2>
    <p class="lead" data-v9-reveal style="--d:120ms">
      A leadership seat, a whole hiring function, a team in India, or a read on the people you already have.
    </p>
    <div class="sv-accs">
      <details class="sv-acc" id="sv-iaas" data-v9-reveal style="--d:0ms">
        <summary class="sv-acc-q"
          ><b>Interview as a service</b><span class="sv-acc-l"
            >You give us candidates you already have. A scored write-up on each, all against the same bar.</span
          ><span class="sv-acc-m">48 hours a batch<i>Per interview, plus a success fee</i></span><span
            class="faq-ic"
            aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
        >
        <div class="sv-acc-a">
          <div>
            <ul>
              <li>30 to 45 minutes each, on questions written from their CV</li><li>
                Scored against your criteria, with the open questions named
              </li><li>Vendor and referral candidates ranked side by side</li><li>
                The recording and transcript of every interview
              </li>
            </ul><p>Works for three candidates or thirty. Who you progress stays your call.</p><a
              class="link"
              href={v9Href('/__v9/contact?service=iaas', Astro.url.pathname)}>Ask about this ›</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="sv-acc" id="sv-managed" data-v9-reveal style="--d:40ms">
        <summary class="sv-acc-q"
          ><b>Managed hiring</b><span class="sv-acc-l"
            >You give us your hiring function. We run it end to end, with named recruiters inside your team. The hires
            are yours.</span
          ><span class="sv-acc-m">Ongoing<i>Monthly retainer, plus a fee per hire</i></span><span
            class="faq-ic"
            aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
        >
        <div class="sv-acc-a">
          <div>
            <ul>
              <li>Named recruiters and interviewers on your roles</li><li>
                Your scorecards reused on every requisition
              </li><li>A weekly working session with your TA team</li><li>
                A quarterly refresh as the organisation changes
              </li>
            </ul><p>For teams hiring steadily through the year.</p><a
              class="link"
              href={v9Href('/__v9/contact?service=managed', Astro.url.pathname)}>Ask about this ›</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="sv-acc" id="sv-exec" data-v9-reveal style="--d:80ms">
        <summary class="sv-acc-q"
          ><b>Executive search</b><span class="sv-acc-l"
            >You give us a leadership seat. A confidential shortlist, and a map of who else exists.</span
          ><span class="sv-acc-m">6–10 weeks<i>Retained in stages</i></span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"
          ></span></summary
        >
        <div class="sv-acc-a">
          <div>
            <ul>
              <li>The role is never posted</li><li>Every finalist interviewed by someone who has held that seat</li><li>
                A market map, including who said no and why
              </li><li>A board-ready write-up on each finalist</li>
            </ul><p>For CXOs, function heads and country leaders, where a wrong hire costs years.</p><a
              class="link"
              href={v9Href('/__v9/contact?service=exec', Astro.url.pathname)}>Ask about this ›</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="sv-acc" id="sv-delivery" data-v9-reveal style="--d:120ms">
        <summary class="sv-acc-q"
          ><b>Managed delivery team</b><span class="sv-acc-l"
            >You give us a scope and a date. A team of ours that does the work and reports to you weekly.</span
          ><span class="sv-acc-m">Per scope<i>Fixed price</i></span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"
          ></span></summary
        >
        <div class="sv-acc-a">
          <div>
            <ul>
              <li>A team shaped around the work</li><li>Everyone on it interviewed against your scorecard</li><li>
                A weekly demo and one named lead
              </li><li>Scope and exit criteria written before anyone starts</li>
            </ul><p>It ends when the scope ends.</p><a
              class="link"
              href={v9Href('/__v9/contact?service=delivery', Astro.url.pathname)}>Ask about this ›</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="sv-acc" id="sv-bot" data-v9-reveal style="--d:160ms">
        <summary class="sv-acc-q"
          ><b>Build, operate, transfer</b><span class="sv-acc-l"
            >You give us a headcount plan for India. We hire the team, run it, then hand it to your entity.</span
          ><span class="sv-acc-m">4–18 months<i>Fixed price</i></span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"
          ></span></summary
        >
        <div class="sv-acc-a">
          <div>
            <ul>
              <li>Build: hired against your criteria</li><li>
                Operate: we run delivery, payroll and compliance while it matures
              </li><li>
                Transfer: people, contracts and knowledge move to your entity on a date set in the contract
              </li><li>Retention through transfer is the number we’re measured on</li>
            </ul><p>The usual route into India for teams not ready to open an entity.</p><a
              class="link"
              href={v9Href('/__v9/contact?service=bot', Astro.url.pathname)}>Ask about this ›</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="sv-acc" id="sv-team" data-v9-reveal style="--d:200ms">
        <summary class="sv-acc-q"
          ><b>Team assessment</b><span class="sv-acc-l"
            >You give us your current team. A straight read on each person against the bar you’d hire to today.</span
          ><span class="sv-acc-m">2 weeks<i>Fixed fee</i></span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
        >
        <div class="sv-acc-a">
          <div>
            <ul>
              <li>Each person read against the same criteria</li><li>
                Where the team is strong, thin and duplicated
              </li><li>What your next three hires should be</li><li>
                Feedback shared with each person, as well as with you
              </li>
            </ul><p>Also how buyers read an engineering team before an acquisition.</p><a
              class="link"
              href={v9Href('/__v9/contact?service=team', Astro.url.pathname)}>Ask about this ›</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="sv-acc" id="sv-library" data-v9-reveal style="--d:240ms">
        <summary class="sv-acc-q"
          ><b>Scorecard library</b><span class="sv-acc-l"
            >You give us a role family. A scorecard for every level, and a panel trained to use them.</span
          ><span class="sv-acc-m">2 weeks<i>Fixed fee</i></span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
        >
        <div class="sv-acc-a">
          <div>
            <ul>
              <li>One scorecard per level, mid-level to head of function</li><li>
                Interview guides your own panel can run
              </li><li>A calibration workshop on real transcripts</li><li>A quarterly refresh as roles change</li>
            </ul><p>Your team runs it without us afterwards.</p><a
              class="link"
              href={v9Href('/__v9/contact?service=library', Astro.url.pathname)}>Ask about this ›</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="sv-acc" id="sv-process" data-v9-reveal style="--d:280ms">
        <summary class="sv-acc-q"
          ><b>Hiring process review</b><span class="sv-acc-l"
            >You give us last year’s hires and leavers. A written analysis of what your process keeps missing.</span
          ><span class="sv-acc-m">3 weeks<i>Fixed fee</i></span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
        >
        <div class="sv-acc-a">
          <div>
            <ul>
              <li>Twelve months of hires and leavers, scored against criteria written today</li><li>
                Where your interview-to-hire ratio goes
              </li><li>The criterion your process never tested</li><li>
                What we’d change, in order of what it costs you
              </li>
            </ul><p>A report you can take to your board. No hiring attached.</p><a
              class="link"
              href={v9Href('/__v9/contact?service=process', Astro.url.pathname)}>Ask about this ›</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
